  "note": "The En's salient projects toward us (an enclave for us, MW s9 para 2 a p 124); its approaches are few, obvious and strongly held (para 4 a p 127). The second form of manoeuvre of MW s9 para 9 p 130: the salient divided through a wedge for subsequent reduction, laid on Figure 5 (p 131): the main attack from a flank into the middle of the salient, the secondary attack up through its tip to meet it, a fixing force on the other flank, an infiltration force to the base to block his reinforcement (para 10 p 132). Each part is then reduced in turn. Assembly at more than one place (para 8 p 130); the artillery split across the prongs and the DAA in two (para 13-14 p 133). Figure 4 (the base from both flanks) is bde-attk-mtn-salient.",
